      "purpose": "`temporal` is immutable temporal algebra for Go. It provides bounded instant and civil-date periods, explicit endpoint bounds, Allen relations, normalized period sets, fixed elapsed durations, local times, circular daily intervals, strict notation, versioned scalar/set encoding, PostgreSQL range adapters, and bounded parsers and iterators.",
